Subject: [PATCH] Add One Euro filter to smooth hand landmark jitter

Smooth normalized and world landmark coordinates per hand (keyed by
handedness) before drawing and CSV output. Filters reset when a hand
leaves the frame. Adds --no-smoothing, --min-cutoff, --beta, and
--d-cutoff flags and documents tuning in the README.

